orelse over a computed primary that reads only fields 0.0 always has: the
fallback could never apply.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	count: int32
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	total: int64
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		total: orelse(v0_0.count * 2, 0)
		count: drop
	}
}
-- out/error --
0.0 always has every field v0_0.count * 2 reads, so orelse's fallback could never apply: write total: v0_0.count * 2:
    1.0.thema:8:17
